<!doctype html>
<html lang="en-GB">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>UK Race & Ballot Tracker</title>
<meta name="description" content="Major UK races with ballot and entry dates, plus calendar feeds with reminders.">
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #fbfbf9; --surface: #ffffff; --text: #1d1d1b; --muted: #5f5f5a; --line: #e3e2dc;
    --accent: #0b6e4f; --accent-soft: #e2f1eb; --warn: #8a5a00; --warn-soft: #fbf0d9;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root {
      --bg: #141413; --surface: #1d1d1b; --text: #ecebe6; --muted: #a3a29b; --line: #34332f;
      --accent: #5ac39a; --accent-soft: #183a2e; --warn: #e6b45a; --warn-soft: #3a2e17;
    }
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { margin: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text);
         font: 16px/1.5 system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; }
  main { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px 16px 48px; }
  h1 { font-size: 1.75rem; margin: 0 0 4px; }
  h2 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 32px 0 12px; }
  a { color: var(--accent); }
  .lede, .meta, .muted { color: var(--muted); }
  .meta { font-size: .875rem; }
  .notice { background: var(--warn-soft); color: var(--warn); border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px 14px; margin: 16px 0; font-size: .9rem; }
  .card { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px 16px; }
  .deadlines { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 8px; }
  .deadlines li { display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: baseline; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .deadlines time { font-weight: 600; min-width: 9.5em; }
  .feeds { display: grid; gap: 10px; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); }
  .feeds h3 { margin: 0 0 2px; font-size: 1rem; }
  .feeds p { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: .875rem; }
  .buttons { display: flex; gap: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .buttons a { text-decoration: none; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; padding: 3px 9px; font-size: .85rem; }
  .buttons a:hover { background: var(--accent-soft); }
  .help { margin-top: 12px; display: grid; gap: 8px; }
  .help details { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 16px; font-size: .9rem; }
  .help summary { cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; }
  .help ul { padding-left: 20px; margin: 8px 0; }
  .help li { margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .help p { margin: 8px 0; }
  .filters { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .filters label { display: flex; flex-direction: column; font-size: .8rem; color: var(--muted); }
  select { font: inherit; color: var(--text); background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; padding: 4px 8px; }
  .table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; background: var(--surface); }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: .9rem; }
  th, td { text-align: left; padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); vertical-align: top; }
  th { font-size: .8rem; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; }
  tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 0; }
  .race-name { font-weight: 600; }
  .tag { display: inline-block; font-size: .75rem; padding: 1px 7px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent-soft); color: var(--accent); white-space: nowrap; }
  .tag.unconfirmed { background: var(--warn-soft); color: var(--warn); }
  .empty { padding: 16px; color: var(--muted); }
  footer { margin-top: 40px; font-size: .85rem; color: var(--muted); }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <h1>UK Race & Ballot Tracker</h1>
  <p class="lede">Major UK races, when their ballots open and close, and calendar feeds that remind you.</p>
  <p class="notice">Always confirm dates on the official site. Not affiliated with any race.</p>

  <h2>Upcoming deadlines (next 30 days)</h2>
  <div class="card">
    {% if deadlines %}
    <ul class="deadlines">
      {% for e in deadlines %}
      <li>
        <time datetime="{{ (e.at or e.day).isoformat() }}">{{ e.day.strftime('%a %d %b') }}{% if e.at %} {{ e.at.strftime('%H:%M') }}{% endif %}</time>
        <span>{{ e.summary }}{% if e.race.entry_url %} · <a href="{{ e.race.entry_url }}" rel="noopener">entry page</a>{% endif %}</span>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    {% else %}
    <p class="muted" style="margin:0">No confirmed ballot or entry dates in the next 30 days.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>

  <h2>Get reminders in your calendar</h2>
  <p class="muted">Subscribe once and new dates appear by themselves. Reminders arrive as their own events, such as “Ballot closes in 2 days”. Google Calendar can take up to a day to pick up changes.</p>
  <div class="feeds">
    {% for f in feeds %}
    <div class="card">
      <h3>{{ f.title }}</h3>
      <p class="muted">{{ f.description }}</p>
      <div class="buttons">
        {% set slug = f.filename[:-4] %}
        <a href="{{ f.google }}" rel="noopener" data-goatcounter-click="subscribe-{{ slug }}-google" data-goatcounter-title="Subscribe: {{ f.title }} (Google)">Google</a>
        <a href="{{ f.webcal }}" data-goatcounter-click="subscribe-{{ slug }}-apple" data-goatcounter-title="Subscribe: {{ f.title }} (Apple)">Apple</a>
        <a href="{{ f.outlook }}" rel="noopener" data-goatcounter-click="subscribe-{{ slug }}-outlook" data-goatcounter-title="Subscribe: {{ f.title }} (Outlook)">Outlook</a>
        <a href="{{ f.filename }}" data-goatcounter-click="subscribe-{{ slug }}-ics" data-goatcounter-title="Subscribe: {{ f.title }} (.ics)">.ics</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <div class="help">
    <details>
      <summary>Not showing on your phone?</summary>
      <p>Google adds new calendars on the web but often leaves them switched off on phones. Turn it on once and it stays on. It can take a few minutes to appear.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Android, Google Calendar app:</strong> tap ☰ → Settings → the calendar’s name under your account → turn on <em>Sync</em>. Then tick it in the ☰ menu.</li>
        <li><strong>iPhone, Google Calendar app:</strong> tap ☰ and tick the calendar. If it isn’t listed, open Settings → your account and switch it on.</li>
        <li><strong>iPhone, Apple Calendar with a Google account:</strong> on your phone, open <a href="https://calendar.google.com/calendar/syncselect" rel="noopener">calendar.google.com/calendar/syncselect</a>, tick the calendar and tap Save. Then tick it under Calendars in the Calendar app.</li>
      </ul>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>How to remove it</summary>
      <p>Subscribed calendars are read-only, which is how dates stay up to date, so single events can’t be deleted. Hide or remove the whole calendar instead.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Hide it:</strong> untick it in your calendar list. You stay subscribed.</li>
        <li><strong>Google Calendar:</strong> on a computer, open Settings → the calendar’s name under “Settings for other calendars” → <em>Unsubscribe</em>.</li>
        <li><strong>Apple Calendar:</strong> open Calendars, tap ⓘ next to the calendar → <em>Delete Calendar</em>.</li>
        <li><strong>Outlook:</strong> right-click the calendar → <em>Remove</em>.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Want fewer events? Subscribe to “UK race ballots” instead, which has ballot windows only.</p>
    </details>
  </div>

  <h2>All races</h2>
  <div class="filters">
    <label>Region
      <select id="f-region">
        <option value="">All</option>
        <option value="uk">UK</option>
        <option value="international">International</option>
      </select>
    </label>
    <label>Distance
      <select id="f-distance">
        <option value="">All</option>
        <option value="marathon">Marathon</option>
        <option value="half">Half</option>
        <option value="10k">10K</option>
        <option value="ultra">Ultra</option>
        <option value="other">Other</option>
      </select>
    </label>
    <label>Entry type
      <select id="f-entry">
        <option value="">All</option>
        <option value="ballot">Ballot</option>
        <option value="general">General</option>
        <option value="charity">Charity</option>
        <option value="gfa">Good for age</option>
      </select>
    </label>
    <label>Race month
      <select id="f-month">
        <option value="">All</option>
        {% for m in ['January','February','March','April','May','June','July','August','September','October','November','December'] %}
        <option value="{{ loop.index }}">{{ m }}</option>
        {% endfor %}
      </select>
    </label>
  </div>
  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Race</th><th>Distance</th><th>Race date</th><th>Entry</th><th>Ballot window (UK time)</th><th>Status</th><th>Last verified</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody id="races">
        {% for r in races %}
        <tr data-region="{{ 'uk' if r.is_uk else 'international' }}" data-distance="{{ r.distance.value }}"data-entry="{{ r.entry_type | map(attribute='value') | join(' ') }}" data-month="{{ r.race_date.month if r.race_date else '' }}">
          <td>
            <div class="race-name">{% if r.entry_url %}<a href="{{ r.entry_url }}" rel="noopener">{{ r.name }}</a>{% else %}{{ r.name }}{% endif %} {{ r.year }}</div>
            <div class="meta">{{ r.location }}{% if not r.is_uk %}, {{ r.country }}{% endif %}{% if r.notes %} · {{ r.notes }}{% endif %}</div>
          </td>
          <td>{{ distance_label(r.distance) }}</td>
          <td>
            {% if r.race_date_end %}{{ r.race_date.strftime('%d') }}–{{ r.race_date_end.strftime('%d %b %Y') }}
            {% elif r.race_date %}{{ r.race_date.strftime('%d %b %Y') }}{% else %}<span class="muted">TBC</span>{% endif %}
          </td>
          <td>{% for e in r.entry_type %}{{ entry_label(e) }}{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}</td>
          <td>
            {% if r.ballot_opens or r.ballot_closes %}
              {{ r.ballot_opens.strftime('%d %b %H:%M') if r.ballot_opens else '?' }} – {{ r.ballot_closes.strftime('%d %b %H:%M') if r.ballot_closes else '?' }}
            {% elif r.has_ballot %}<span class="muted">TBC</span>
            {% else %}<span class="muted">No ballot</span>{% endif %}
            {% if r.general_entry_opens %}<div class="meta">Entry opens {{ r.general_entry_opens.strftime('%d %b %H:%M') }}</div>{% endif %}
          </td>
          <td>
            <span class="tag">{{ status_label(r.status) }}</span>
            {% if r.confidence != confirmed %}<span class="tag unconfirmed" title="Not yet confirmed on the official site; not in the calendar feeds">{{ r.confidence.value }}</span>{% endif %}
          </td>
          <td>{{ r.last_verified.strftime('%d %b %Y') if r.last_verified else '—' }}</td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p class="empty" id="no-match" hidden>No races match these filters.</p>
  </div>

  <footer>
    {% if suggest_url %}
    <p><a href="{{ suggest_url }}" rel="noopener">Suggest a race or report a change</a></p>
    {% endif %}
    <p>Only confirmed dates go into the calendar feeds. Dates marked “estimated” or “expected” are guides only.</p>
    {% if goatcounter_url %}
    <p>Visits are counted anonymously with <a href="https://www.goatcounter.com/" rel="noopener">GoatCounter</a>: no cookies, no personal data.</p>
    {% endif %}
    <p>Updated {{ generated_at.strftime('%d %b %Y %H:%M') }} UTC.</p>
  </footer>
</main>
<script>
  (function () {
    var ids = ["f-region", "f-distance", "f-entry", "f-month"];
    var rows = Array.prototype.slice.call(document.querySelectorAll("#races tr"));
    function apply() {
      var g = document.getElementById("f-region").value;
      var d = document.getElementById("f-distance").value;
      var e = document.getElementById("f-entry").value;
      var m = document.getElementById("f-month").value;
      var shown = 0;
      rows.forEach(function (row) {
        var ok = (!g || row.dataset.region === g) &&
                 (!d || row.dataset.distance === d) &&
                 (!e || row.dataset.entry.split(" ").indexOf(e) !== -1) &&
                 (!m || row.dataset.month === m);
        row.hidden = !ok;
        if (ok) shown++;
      });
      document.getElementById("no-match").hidden = shown !== 0;
    }
    ids.forEach(function (id) { document.getElementById(id).addEventListener("change", apply); });
  })();
</script>
{% if goatcounter_url %}
<script data-goatcounter="{{ goatcounter_url }}" async src="https://gc.zgo.at/count.js"></script>
{% endif %}
</body>
</html>
